 "category": "accents",
 "description": {
  "id": "Inti tetap di tengah menjadi jangkar bagi satelit yang mengorbit di elips miring masing-masing. Putaran melambat secara deterministik sampai setiap satelit berhenti di posisi akhir yang tersusun rapi, lalu labelnya muncul. Satelit di belakang inti tampak lebih kecil dan redup.",
  "en": "A fixed nucleus anchors satellites on their own tilted elliptical orbits. The spin decelerates deterministically until every satellite settles into a composed lockup and its label appears; satellites behind the nucleus read smaller and dimmer."
 },
